# Design system core

Dependencies flow downward: vision → foundations → components → patterns. Governance applies to every layer.

- Token values live in `docs/tokens/`. Specs cite names, not raw hex or px.
- Color roles follow `color-{element}-{hierarchy}-{state}`. Default state is `$root`.
- `color.action.*` is for control fills. `color.surface.*` is for containers. `color.icon.*` is for icons.
- Prefer editing an existing doc over adding a second one that says the same thing.
- When a rule is missing, add a decisions-backlog entry. Do not invent a conflicting rule.
- Read `AGENTS.md` for the full order of work.
